Check eligibility:
- account_type is checking;
- status is OPEN;
- the account has been open at least 3 business days, counted from date_opened to today, excluding weekends;
- no ACTIVE card on the account;
- no PENDING card on the account;
- balance at least $25;
- the customer is at least 18 (date_of_birth);
- the address on file is a valid US domestic address.
If any check fails, tell the customer what must be resolved and do not order.
